# Dozzle – Docker log viewer. Copy to stack.env and adjust. Run ./prepare-stack.sh before first deploy (syncs stack.env → .env for Compose; only selected vars are injected into the container).
# Docs: https://dozzle.dev/

# Host directory mounted at /data (simple auth users.yaml lives here). Default ~/.config/dozzle.
# Portainer / non-shell deploy: set to an absolute path, e.g. /home/you/.config/dozzle
DOZZLE_CONFIG_DIR=${HOME}/.config/dozzle

# Simple auth: ./prepare-stack.sh copies users.yaml.example → DOZZLE_CONFIG_DIR/users.yaml when missing; then uncomment:
# DOZZLE_AUTH_PROVIDER=simple

# TZ/locale: prefer ../../shared.env (see documents/SHARED-RESOURCES.md). Optional overrides here.
